Catppuccin palette (MIT), in the optional Catppuccin themes package.

The hull silhouettes of the Fit manager (plugins/fitmanager/static/hulls) are traced from the Fenris Creations ship renders, through the ship images of eve-cyno-web, and compacted by plugins/fitmanager/scripts/gen-hulls.mjs (one path per hull, faction colours baked in); they are not the game's own files. The game render and the module icons shown by the Fit manager are loaded from the FC image server (images.evetech.net) and are not shipped.

The Intel alarm sounds (plugins/intel/static/sounds) are CC0 recordings from Freesound, OpenGameArt and Kenney, cut and levelled; plugins/intel/README.md lists each one.

